# EnZIM Annotation System - Data Flow & Architecture Diagrams

## Annotation Creation Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant ReaderView
    participant CanvasLayer as CanvasAnnotationLayer
    participant TextHighlighter
    participant AnnotationPanel
    participant Store as useAnnotationStore
    participant Storage as IndexedDB + Files

    alt Click-to-Stick Annotation
        User->>CanvasLayer: Click on article content
        CanvasLayer->>CanvasLayer: calculateRelativePosition()
        CanvasLayer->>ReaderView: handleCanvasPlacement(x, y, type)
        ReaderView->>AnnotationPanel: Open at position
        User->>AnnotationPanel: Create annotation (voice/ink/text/photo/video)
        AnnotationPanel->>Store: addAnnotation()
        Store->>Storage: Persist to IndexedDB
        Store->>Storage: Save media blob to app-private files
        Store-->>CanvasLayer: Update pinnedAnnotations
        CanvasLayer-->>User: Render pin icon on canvas
    else Text Highlight
        User->>TextHighlighter: Select text
        TextHighlighter->>TextHighlighter: getSelectionInfo()
        TextHighlighter->>TextHighlighter: generateSelector()
        User->>TextHighlighter: Choose highlight color
        TextHighlighter->>Store: addAnnotation(type: 'highlight')
        Store->>Storage: Persist to IndexedDB
        Store-->>TextHighlighter: Update highlights
        TextHighlighter-->>User: Render highlight overlay
    end
```

## Sidecar Bundle Export Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant ReaderView
    participant ExportDialog as BundleExportDialog
    participant BundleUtil as annotationBundle.ts
    participant ZIMService as zimService.ts
    participant Store as useAnnotationStore
    participant Storage as App Files
    participant UserDevice as Downloads/Share

    User->>ReaderView: Click Export button
    ReaderView->>ExportDialog: Open export dialog
    ExportDialog->>Store: getAnnotationsForArticle()
    Store-->>ExportDialog: annotations[]
    User->>ExportDialog: Confirm export
    ExportDialog->>ZIMService: Get current archive path
    ZIMService-->>ExportDialog: filePath
    ExportDialog->>BundleUtil: computeZIMFingerprint(filePath)
    BundleUtil-->>ExportDialog: fingerprint
    ExportDialog->>BundleUtil: exportAnnotationBundle(annotations, fingerprint, ...)
    BundleUtil->>Storage: Read media blobs
    BundleUtil->>BundleUtil: Create ZIP with manifest + metadata + annotations/
    BundleUtil-->>ExportDialog: bundleBlob
    ExportDialog->>UserDevice: Trigger download via URL.createObjectURL()
    UserDevice-->>User: .enzim file saved
```

## Sidecar Bundle Import Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant ReaderView
    participant ImportDialog as BundleImportDialog
    participant BundleUtil as annotationBundle.ts
    participant Store as useAnnotationStore
    participant ZIMService as zimService.ts
    participant Storage as IndexedDB + Files

    User->>ReaderView: Click Import button
    ReaderView->>ImportDialog: Open import dialog
    User->>ImportDialog: Select .enzim file
    ImportDialog->>BundleUtil: extractManifest(bundleBlob)
    BundleUtil-->>ImportDialog: manifest
    ImportDialog->>ZIMService: Get current archive fingerprint
    ZIMService-->>ImportDialog: localFingerprint
    ImportDialog->>BundleUtil: verifyZIMFingerprint(manifest.zimFingerprint, localFingerprint)
    alt Fingerprints Match
        BundleUtil-->>ImportDialog: true
        ImportDialog-->>User: Show "Verified" status
        User->>ImportDialog: Confirm import
        ImportDialog->>BundleUtil: importAnnotationBundle(bundleBlob, localFingerprint)
        BundleUtil->>BundleUtil: Extract ZIP, parse annotations
        BundleUtil-->>ImportDialog: { manifest, annotations[] }
        ImportDialog->>Store: importAnnotations(annotations)
        Store->>Storage: Persist to IndexedDB
        Store->>Storage: Save media blobs
        Store-->>ReaderView: Update annotation state
        ReaderView-->>User: Render imported pins/highlights
    else Fingerprints Mismatch
        BundleUtil-->>ImportDialog: false
        ImportDialog-->>User: Show warning with zimSource info
        User->>ImportDialog: Cancel or proceed anyway
    end
```

