## Sharing Protocol Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Export["Export Flow"]
        Annotations[Annotation[]] -->|exportAnnotationBundle| Bundle[.enzim ZIP Bundle]
        ZIMFile[ZIM File] -->|computeZIMFingerprint| Fingerprint[SHA-256 Fingerprint]
        Fingerprint --> Bundle
        Bundle -->|option 1| Email[Email Attachment]
        Bundle -->|option 2| QRCode[QR Code<br/>max 2KB]
        Bundle -->|option 3| P2P[P2P WebRTC<br/>future]
        Bundle -->|option 4| Cloud[Cloud Storage<br/>future premium]
    end

    subgraph Import["Import Flow"]
        ReceivedBundle[Received .enzim] -->|extractManifest| Manifest[manifest.json]
        LocalZIM[Local ZIM File] -->|computeZIMFingerprint| LocalFingerprint[Local Fingerprint]
        Manifest -->|zimFingerprint| Verify{Verify Match?}
        LocalFingerprint --> Verify
        Verify -->|match| ImportAnnotations[Import Annotations]
        Verify -->|mismatch| ShowWarning[Show Warning<br/>with zimSource]
        ImportAnnotations -->|importAnnotations| Store[useAnnotationStore]
    end

    Email -.-> ReceivedBundle
    QRCode -.-> ReceivedBundle
    P2P -.-> ReceivedBundle
    Cloud -.-> ReceivedBundle
```

