## Annotation Positioning System

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Canvas as CanvasAnnotationLayer
    participant Container as Article Content Container
    participant Store as useAnnotationStore
    participant Render as Render Loop

    User->>Canvas: Click at (clientX, clientY)
    Canvas->>Container: getBoundingClientRect()
    Container-->>Canvas: rect {top, left, width, height}
    Canvas->>Canvas: calculateRelativePosition()
    Note over Canvas: xPercent = ((clientX - rect.left) / rect.width) * 100<br/>yPercent = ((clientY - rect.top) / rect.height) * 100
    Canvas->>Store: addAnnotation({position: {x: xPercent, y: yPercent}})
    Store-->>Canvas: Updated annotations list
    Canvas->>Render: Render pinned annotations
    Render->>Render: For each annotation:<br/>displayX = (xPercent / 100) * containerWidth<br/>displayY = (yPercent / 100) * containerHeight
    Render-->>User: Pin icon at calculated position

    Note over User,Render: On window resize:<br/>Recalculate displayX/displayY from stored percentages
```

