    end

    subgraph Validation["Import Validation"]
        Extract[Extract ZIP] --> ReadManifest[Read manifest.json]
        ReadManifest --> GetLocalFingerprint[Compute local ZIM fingerprint]
        GetLocalFingerprint --> Compare{Compare fingerprints}
        Compare -->|match| Import[Import annotations]
        Compare -->|mismatch| Warning[Show mismatch warning]
    end

    Bundle -.->|imported by| Validation
```

